## Integration acceptance

- Check new-install and restore routes without applying companion branding to authentication.
- Verify discovered, configuring, configured-without-state and rejected authorization examples keep their meanings distinct.
- Confirm synthetic examples contain no real credentials and never navigate to a fake sign-in endpoint.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

